      {
        "id": 12,
        "title": "SCI Theory Overview",
        "type": "text",
        "options": {
          "content": "## SCI Theory Metrics\n\n### Systems Theory (整体性)\n- **Emergence Score**: System output vs sum of individual agents\n- **Component Synergy**: Successful collaborations / total collaborations\n- **Adaptive Capacity**: Successful adaptations / total changes\n\n### Information Theory (信息质量)\n- **Entropy**: Shannon entropy H(X) = -Σ p(x)log₂p(x)\n- **Information Density**: Entropy / Token count\n- **SNR**: Signal (meaningful content) / Noise (redundancy)\n- **Confidence Calibration**: Predicted vs actual accuracy\n\n### Cybernetics (反馈控制)\n- **Feedback Response Time**: Time from issue detection to resolution\n- **Stability Index**: 1 - (oscillation amplitude / target)\n- **Convergence Rate**: Iterations / time to steady-state\n- **Negative Feedback Rate**: Correction signals / total signals"
        },
        "gridPos": {"h": 16, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40}
